ngspice is an external system dependency. It is not copied into the Python
wheel. The reproducibility scripts download and build ngspice 46 from the
official ngspice SourceForge release. ngspice is developed by the ngspice team
from Berkeley SPICE and is distributed under its own notices and license terms.
See https://ngspice.sourceforge.io/ for those terms.

The circuit harness implementations and authored test fixtures in this package
were extracted from the PhyChip/athma-train research code and are released here
under Apache-2.0. No model weights, training corpus rows, private generations,
or benchmark records are included in the wheel.
